# Chapter 5 — Non-Functional Requirements

## Performance

* Lighthouse Performance Score ≥ 95
* First Contentful Paint < 1.8 seconds
* Largest Contentful Paint < 2.5 seconds
* Cumulative Layout Shift < 0.1
* Optimized images using WebP/AVIF
* Lazy loading for below-the-fold assets
* Dynamic imports for non-critical components
* Minified JavaScript and CSS
* Font preloading enabled

---

## Security

* HTTPS enforced
* Environment variables for secrets
* Server-side validation for all form submissions
* Input sanitization
* XSS prevention
* CSRF protection where applicable
* Rate limiting on API routes
* No sensitive data exposed to the client

---

## Accessibility

* WCAG 2.2 AA compliance target
* Semantic HTML structure
* Keyboard navigation support
* ARIA labels for interactive elements
* Visible focus indicators
* Screen reader compatibility
* High color contrast
* Reduced motion support

---

## Responsiveness

Support:

* Mobile (320px+)
* Tablet (768px+)
* Laptop (1024px+)
* Desktop (1440px+)
* Ultra-wide displays

No horizontal scrolling or broken layouts.

---

## Maintainability

* Modular components
* TypeScript strict mode
* Reusable design tokens
* Feature-based architecture
* Clean code standards
* No duplicated business logic

